N: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 85%; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 145%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">년도</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">「</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">국가우수장학금</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이공계</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">」</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">수능우수유형 신규장학생 신청을 다음과 같이 안내합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">가. 대상장학금 : 국가우수장학금(이공계) 수능우수유형 </span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">나. 신청기간 : 2015. 4. 1(수) ~ 4. 15(수) 18:00까지</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 서류 제출기간은 4. 16(목) 18:00까지이며 재단 요청시 서류 제출</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">다. 신청대상 : 대한민국 국적자 중 국내 4년제 대학의 자연과학 및 공학계열 학과(부)에</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;입학한&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 2015년도 우수 신입생</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 단, 등록금 전액을 지원 받는 계약학과 및 면제대상자(국가유공자, 보훈대상자, 탈북</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;대학생)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 학생은 신청대상에서 제외됨</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">라. 신청방법 : 한국장학재단 홈페이지(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><a href=\"http://www.kosaf.go.kr/\">http://www.kosaf.go.kr</a></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">)를 통해 신청</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 마감일 제외 24시간 신청가능하며, 본인 명의 공인인증서 및 대학수학능력시험 성적표</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;준비 필요</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><br>&nbsp; 붙임 : (홈페이지 공고용) 수능우수유형 신규신청 안내문 1부.&nbsp; 끝.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
